                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W4407600                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  SKRIVER LISTA MED RESERV. RESTORDER ÄLDRE ÄN 2 VECKOR *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  LARS THELL                                            *        
*                                                                      *        
*  ÄNDRING    :                                                        *        
*                                                                      *        
*     DATUM       NAMN                     AVDELNING                   *        
*     040830      SM  LOC-PRISER           ......                      *        
*     ......      ..................       ......                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W44076D1                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W44060                                                                         
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
FILE W44076D2 PRINTER FB (121 121)                                              
*                                                                               
JA                   W    1    A   VALUE 'J'                                    
NEJ                  W    1    A   VALUE 'N'                                    
FEL                  W    1    A   VALUE 'F'                                    
*    --- VALID IDDC CODES                                                       
*                                                                               
%WWDC99                                                                         
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
WDATKONV             W    8    A   VALUE 'WDATKONV'                             
WORKDAY              W    8    A   VALUE 'WORKDAY '                             
W-IDORDNR5           W    5    A                                                
W-IDARTNR            W    5    P                                                
W-IDKUNDNR           W    4    P                                                
W-IDDISTR            W    4    P                                                
W-TIAA               W    2    N                                                
W-TIDDD              W    3    N                                                
W-TIRODAT            W    6    N                                                
W-KVART              W    7    N   MASK 'ZZZZZZ9'                               
W-KDFRAKT            W    2    N   MASK 'Z9'                                    
W-PRARTNTO           W    9    N   2 MASK 'ZZZZZZ9.99'                          
W-KDORDKL            W    1    N                                                
W-TIRES              W    6    N                                                
W-ANTAL-DAGAR        W    3    N                                                
SKRIV-UT-SW          W    1    A   VALUE 'N'                                    
RKOD-16              W    4    N   VALUE 16                                     
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
WDATAREA             W    8    A   VALUE 'WDATAREA'                             
%WDATAREA                                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
WORKAREA             W    8    A   VALUE 'WORKAREA'                             
%WORKAREA                                                                       
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
* STEG 1. SKAPAR LISTA                                                          
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W44076D1)                                     +                      
  START A-INIT                                                                  
                                                                                
  W-IDDISTR            = RAD-IDDISTR                                            
  W-IDKUNDNR           = RAD-IDKUNDNR                                           
  W-IDARTNR            = RAD-IDARTNR                                            
  W-IDORDNR5           = RAD-IDORDNR5                                           
  W-TIRODAT            = RAD-DARODAT                                            
  W-TIRES              = RAD-TIRES                                              
  W-KVART              = RAD-KVART                                              
  W-KDORDKL            = RAD-KDORDKL                                            
  W-KDFRAKT            = RAD-KDFRAKT                                            
  IF RAD-PRAVCOST > 0                                                           
     W-PRARTNTO        = RAD-PRAVCOST                                           
  ELSE                                                                          
     W-PRARTNTO        = RAD-PRARTNTO                                           
  END-IF                                                                        
  IF RAD-PRARTNTO = 0                                                           
    W-PRARTNTO         = RAD-PRARTNTO-LOC                                       
    IF W-PRARTNTO = 0                                                           
      W-PRARTNTO       = RAD-PRARTNTO-LOCPREL                                   
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
  IF RAD-DARODAT       > 0                                                      
    IF RAD-KDSTARAD  = '3'                                                      
       PERFORM B-KOLLA-OM-UTSKRIFT                                              
       IF SKRIV-UT-SW = JA                                                      
          PRINT RAPPORT01                                                       
       END-IF                                                                   
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
                                                                                
  A-INIT.  PROC                                                                 
                                                                                
      DAT-KDDATFORM = 'IDAG  '                                                  
                                                                                
      CALL WDATKONV USING (DAT-KDDATFORM                         +              
                           DAT-I-TIDATUM                         +              
                           DAT-O-TIDATUM                         +              
                           DAT-KDSVAR    )                                      
                                                                                
      IF DAT-KDSVAR = FEL                                                       
         RETURN-CODE = RKOD-16                                                  
         DISPLAY 'FEL-FRÅN-DATKONV'                                             
         DISPLAY 'DAT-O-TIDATUM*=' DAT-O-TIDATUM                                
         STOP EXECUTE                                                           
      ELSE                                                                      
         MOVE DAT-TIAA-DAGNR         TO W-TIAA                                  
         MOVE DAT-TIDDD              TO W-TIDDD                                 
      END-IF                                                                    
                                                                                
    END-PROC                                                                    
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
  B-KOLLA-OM-UTSKRIFT. PROC                                                     
                                                                                
      WORK-TIAAMMDD-TOM       = DAT-TIAAMMDD                                    
      WORK-TIAAMMDD-FOM       = W-TIRES                                         
      WORK-IDDC               = CDC-SE                                          
      WORK-KDCALL             = 001                                             
                                                                                
      CALL WORKDAY  USING (WORK-KDCALL                           +              
                           WORK-DATE-AREA                        +              
                           WORK-KDSVAR   )                                      
                                                                                
      IF WORK-KDSVAR = FEL                                                      
*        RETURN-CODE = RKOD-16                                                  
*        DISPLAY 'FEL-FRÅN-WORKDAY '                                            
*        DISPLAY 'DAT-TIAAMMDD*=' DAT-TIAAMMDD                                  
*        DISPLAY 'W-TIRES******=' W-TIRES                                       
*        STOP EXECUTE                                                           
         SKRIV-UT-SW                 =  NEJ                                     
      ELSE                                                                      
         IF  WORK-KVWORKD            >  10                                      
            SKRIV-UT-SW              =  JA                                      
         ELSE                                                                   
            SKRIV-UT-SW              =  NEJ                                     
         END-IF                                                                 
      END-IF                                                                    
                                                                                
    END-PROC                                                                    
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
                                                                                
  REPORT RAPPORT01 PRINTER W44076D2                              +              
                   LINESIZE     120                              +              
                   PAGESIZE      41                              +              
                   NODATE                                        +              
                   NOADJUST                                      +              
                   NOSPREAD                                      +              
                   TITLESKIP 2                                   +              
                   SPACE          1                                             
                                                                                
                                                                                
    SEQUENCE         W-IDDISTR                                   +              
                     W-IDKUNDNR                                  +              
                     W-IDARTNR                                                  
                                                                                
  TITLE 01                                                       +              
      COL 02 'VOLVO CAR PARTS               W44076-001 '         +              
      COL 93 SYSDATE                                                            
                                                                                
  TITLE 02                                                       +              
      COL 10 '                      '                                           
                                                                                
  TITLE 03                                                       +              
      COL 10 'RESERVERADE RESTORDERRADER ÄLDRE ÄN TVÅ VECKOR '                  
                                                                                
  HEADING  W-IDDISTR        'DISTR'                                             
  HEADING  W-IDKUNDNR       'KUND'                                              
  HEADING  W-IDARTNR        'ART NR'                                            
  HEADING  RAD-IDKONTO      'KONTO'                                             
  HEADING  RAD-IDKST        'KST'                                               
  HEADING  W-IDORDNR5       'ORDER'                                             
  HEADING  W-KDFRAKT        'FK'                                                
  HEADING  W-KDORDKL        'KL '                                               
  HEADING  RAD-KDFAKTYP     'F TYP'                                             
  HEADING  W-TIRES          'RES DAT'                                           
  HEADING  W-TIRODAT        'RO DAT'                                            
  HEADING  W-KVART          'ANTAL'                                             
  HEADING  W-PRARTNTO       'ART PRIS'                                          
                                                                                
  LINE 01                                                        +              
           W-IDDISTR                                             +              
           W-IDKUNDNR                                            +              
           W-IDARTNR                                             +              
           RAD-IDKONTO                                           +              
           RAD-IDKST                                             +              
           W-IDORDNR5                                            +              
           W-KDFRAKT                                             +              
           W-KDORDKL                                             +              
           RAD-KDFAKTYP                                          +              
           W-TIRODAT                                             +              
           W-TIRES                                               +              
           W-KVART                                               +              
           W-PRARTNTO                                                           
                                                                                
